                                <span class="service-link">順路安排，更有彈性</span>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
                        <article class="service-card service-seat h-100">
                            <div class="service-content">
                                <span class="service-number">02</span>
                                <h3>嬰兒座椅選配</h3>
                                <p>親子出行提前預約合適座椅，讓孩子在車內也能舒適乘坐。</p>
                                <span class="service-link">安心防護，照顧同行</span>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
                        <article class="service-card service-flight h-100">
                            <div class="service-content">
                                <span class="service-number">03</span>
                                <h3>航班狀態追蹤</h3>
                                <p>掌握航班抵達資訊，遇到提前或延誤也能彈性調整接送時間。</p>
                                <span class="service-link">即時掌握，準時等候</span>
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    <!-- Footer 請使用你原本的 Layout -->

<!-- 前端查登入資料的測試(Member新增) -->
<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome</h1>
    <p>Learn about <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core">building Web apps with ASP.NET Core</a>.</p>
</div>
<button id="tempButton">測試前端取得資料按鈕</button>

<script>
    document.getElementById('tempButton').addEventListener('click', async function () {
        const response = await fetch('/api/auth/me');
        const auth = await response.json();

        console.log(auth);

        if (!auth.isAuthenticated) {
            alert('目前尚未登入');
            return;
        }

        if (auth.role === 'passenger') {
            alert(`乘客帳號：${auth.userId}`);
        }

        if (auth.role === 'driver') {
            alert(`司機帳號：${auth.driverId}`);
        }
    });
</script>